  "_overrides_moved_to_root": "npm honours `overrides` only in the package it installs from. Since this repo became an npm workspace (root package-lock.json is the only lockfile), that package is the ROOT — the two entries that used to sit here were inert. They looked live: `sharp` was pinned in both files and `npm ls` showed 0.35.3, but that came from the root's entry, not this one. Measured 2026-09-10 while closing a sharp advisory: bumping only this file would have changed nothing and read as done. Both pins now live in the root package.json; this key exists so the next person does not re-add them here."
